    "meaning_english": "The सुँ / अम् प्रत्यय occurring after the words ending in डतर and डतम प्रत्यय, and after the words 'अन्य', 'अन्यतर', 'इतर' gets the अद्ड् आदेश.",
    "audio_url": null,
